     "body": "<p>Discussed Committers Meeting 2010-05-18.</p>\n\n<p>The new REST API copes with URL-encoded PIDs, so using that would be the proposed solution.  Also it was expressed that we don't really want to do too much more work on the LITE APIs as they are due to be deprecated.</p>",
